  "description": "Certificate of Lawful Development (Existing): Five self contained flats",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the dwellinghouse at No.2-4 Montrose Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7DU has been in use as five self-contained residential units for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The use of the dwellinghouse at No.2-4 Montrose Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7DU, as five self-contained residential units, is therefore immune from enforcement action and is therefore lawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
